# Vendored ZX0 decoder (Retro Visual Novel)

This directory vendors the "Standard" (69-byte) ZX0 decompressor by Einar
Saukas with its BSD 3-Clause licence (`LICENSE`), taken from the z88dk source
tree:

    /tmp/z88dk/libsrc/compress/zx0/z80/dzx0_standard.asm

`zx0.asm` exposes it as `_zx0_unpack` (HL = source, DE = destination) in
`SECTION code_user`, so it lands in the always-resident fixed region
(0x8000..0xBFFF) rather than the z88dk clib. The CPC target assembles it with
`-Ca-DZX0_LOW`, which puts it in `SECTION code_l` instead: the CPC pages an
extra bank over 0x4000 while decoding, so the decoder must stay below 0x4000.
The compressor is the host tool
`z88dk-zx0` (already in the z88dk install), invoked by `tools/gen_scenes.py`.

Art, scene and song blobs are compressed with ZX0 and decompressed straight
from the paged bank by `src/zx/paging.asm`. ZX0 is self-terminating, so no stored
length is needed.

